msgstr "![Salida de la celda de código anterior](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/entanglement-in-action/qiskit-implementation/extracted-outputs/ce7568a0-23d2-41d2-aadc-ad898b3a7ebe-0.avif)\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
